# Source media kept out of the repo: large, and not what the app serves.
# `geodesic-01/frames` is the 191 MB PNG export that `scripts/frames-to-webp.mjs`
# converts into `geodesic-01/webp` (9.4 MB) — the WebP set IS committed, since
# the hero sequence cannot render without it. Keep the PNGs backed up outside
# git; re-running the script needs them.
/public/geodesic-01/frames/
# Kling MP4s from the abandoned video-scrubbing approach, superseded by the
# frame sequence. Unused by any route.
/public/videos/
